			"notes": "## Added features\n- Hoppers can now face up.\n\n## Changes\n- The feature which prevented jukeboxes from locking hoppers has been removed due to concerns of being unintuitive. This is mostly because the \"silenced\" jukebox feature fixes the issue anyway simply by preventing the disc from playing in the first place.\n\n## Fixes\n- The startup log now accurately reflects the mod version.\n\n## Other Notes\n- Updated all release version names to better align with semantic versioning (this will cause older versions to have some inconsistencies in their source code)."
		},
